---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure — xxxtea" description="How xxxtea makes money, and what that means for you.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-3">House rules</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-porcelain">Affiliate disclosure.</h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-steep-100 mt-6 leading-relaxed">
      xxxtea is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate
      advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by
      advertising and linking to Amazon.com.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-porcelain mt-10">What that means</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-steep-100 leading-relaxed">
      When you click a link on this site that goes to Amazon and you make a purchase — the
      item we linked to, or anything else in your cart — we receive a small commission from
      Amazon. The price you pay is identical to what you'd pay otherwise. Amazon's commission
      comes out of their margin, not your wallet.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-porcelain mt-10">What it doesn't mean</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-steep-100 leading-relaxed">
      We do not, have not, and will not accept payment for a review. No brand has ever sent
      us product in exchange for coverage. No review on this site has been edited, softened,
      or rewritten at the request of a tea house, kettle maker, or anybody else with skin in
      the game.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-steep-100 leading-relaxed">
      If we say a tea is budget, it's budget. If we say to skip something, we're saying it
      knowing it costs us a commission. That trade-off is the point.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-porcelain mt-10">Cookies &amp; tracking</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-steep-100 leading-relaxed">
      Outbound links carry a <code class="font-mono text-honey-400">tag=xxxtea-20</code> query
      parameter so Amazon attributes the click to us. We use standard Cloudflare Web Analytics
      for traffic measurement (cookie-less). We do not sell or share visitor data. We do not
      run third-party retargeting pixels.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-porcelain mt-10">Questions</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-steep-100 leading-relaxed">
      Email <a href="mailto:hello@xxxtea.com">hello@xxxtea.com</a>. Takedown or correction
      requests go to <a href="mailto:takedown@xxxtea.com">takedown@xxxtea.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
